{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:9630656517d72adf","name":"Sensor Countermeasure Package","source":{"id":"source:reference-9630656517d72adf","title":"Sensor Countermeasure Package","revision":21107,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:10:32Z","sha256":"d5f40629e8fa0432ed4d5abaf45bc6448ee6e90483c1c280da7ae15b0551f75d","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21107","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Sensor%20Countermeasure%20Package&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-9630656517d72adf","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scavenger's Guide to Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scavenger%27s_Guide_to_Droids"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 1,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 2 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"}," operating covertly must avoid drawing attention to themselves. The Sensor Countermeasure Package broadcasts signals that interfere with incoming sensor signals. A ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," equipped with the Sensor Countermeasure Package can make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check to avoid being detected. If the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check equals or exceeds a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check made to detect the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," through any form of non visual sensor ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},", the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"}," remains undetected.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
